WEBVTT

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.910
Documents that are proof of Marquis Paul's embezzlement, you say?

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:50.360
Yes, we've just received word from our mole at the Great Capital Newspaper, "The Subject".

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:56.190
Immediately enter into a state of information control.

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:59.410
Deploy the Fourth Axe and use the police forces...

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:02.870
...to inspect all media and newspaper organizations in the area of the capital.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:06.020
Retrieve all envelopes of the same type; permission granted to open letters.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.520
Yes, sir.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.280
What's the Marquis's schedule right now?

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.110
He is at a ballroom party.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:13.560
Shall we send bodyguards?

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:16.560
This is all very impressive...

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:21.840
The Economic Development Branch can influence the spirit of the people so their information control is impregnable.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.990
Now, how in the world did they get this information?

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.660
That aspect is much more interesting than the Marquis's life.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.720
If we can capture the suspect in the end, then it's all for the better.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.940
Prioritize the siege of the area over protecting the Marquis.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:36.870
Yes, sir.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.060
In order to proceed with questioning of the suspects,

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:42.050
we'll probably need them to have committed the crime of "Marquis killing".

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.620
Let us not waste this ballroom party.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.410
Shall we dance, my princess?

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:12.010
Yes, but I am not trained in dancing-

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:13.570
Come now; I will teach you.

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:15.310
Bring your body closer.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.140
You are very good at this, my princess.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.130
Forgive me.

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:44.760
When a little bird lands on a branch,

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.770
it doesn't hurt the giant tree at all.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:52.560
For you to have chosen these toes among all the shoes in this ballroom, I thank you,

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.240
my little bird-like princess.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.540
Is he a maso-

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.710
Please shut your mouth.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.970
Is something bothering you?

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:12.640
A man that towers into the skies, perhaps?

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.650
I've noticed that after looking at where your eyes lead you.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.560
At times, Princess, you aren't looking at me,

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:25.000
but you're looking over my shoulders... looking up at someone.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:29.480
This someone must be very tall, I presume.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.670
A giant man.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.340
That's what I thought before.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.380
He always stands back up after falling down;

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.660
the owner of a very strong heart.

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.930
But, the reality is...

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.140
...he's not strong at all...

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.510
...he's not giant at all...

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:55.850
The reality is...

00:04:58.660 --> 00:04:59.880
The reality is...

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:05.280
He's...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.660
...not a person that wants to fight with others!

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:13.820
Idiot, aim better!

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:14.870
But...

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.710
Don't think you can get away!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.020
Why...

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.150
Why do I have to point my gun...

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:58.040
at...

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.040
at...

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:04.840
...at the people I wanted to give food to?

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.470
Is something amiss?

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.450
Oh... No...

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:15.240
Let us rest for a bit.

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:31.240
Why?

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.070
You ask why?

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:35.250
The military's no different than the nobles!

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.570
You guys live out a quality life by yourselves!

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:39.460
We're just on the sidelines!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.660
Any one of those kids know this fact, too!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:45.450
That they're living as the leftovers of society?!

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.960
Damn it!!

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:55.000
I was wondering where you were,

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.520
but getting your butt kicked by civilians?

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.060
Damn...

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.980
Give it up, will 'ya?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:09.820
My martial arts grade was below average,

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:14.620
but at cheapshot street fighting...

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.290
...I am undefeated.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:23.040
You... you've done it now, haven't you?

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.420
According to our boss,

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:32.420
the weapon that was responsible for the most kills in the trenches...

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:36.680
...wasn't guns or knives but shovels, you know?

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.680
Want to give it a try?

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:46.690
So, who are these people anyway, big guy?

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.680
Hey, snap out of it, big guy!

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:56.420
Ah...

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:59.320
This dream, again...

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:21.060
Maybe it's not a dream...

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:31.710
Because...

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.650
...I've killed many people...

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.510
It's okay...

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:45.270
The 2nd Lieutenant will appear, and I'll wake up...

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:53.880
2nd Lieutenant?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:09:07.880
Kill! Kill! Kill!

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.550
You shouldn't move!

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:17.830
Go back to sleep.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.580
We'll send you to the hospital right away.

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:25.470
Anyway, let's deal with these two first.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.190
What do you think, Machs?

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.840
Indeed, if these figures are correct,

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:36.280
then a case could be made for Marquis Paul's embezzlement offense.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.950
And fifty copies, including this one, were made.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:43.410
All of them were distributed, through various routes, to media and newspaper outlets.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.380
I give you guys credit for having all this planned out so well,

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:48.060
but where did you guys get this?

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.050
Whatever, guys,

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.650
but this is going to fail.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.570
With a scandal as big as this one,

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:01.880
Section I will take action to preserve the country's security.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.070
Using the pretext of "not letting civilians feel insecure",

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.750
all these documents will be confiscated,

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.340
and all the media will be pressured to keep their mouths shut.

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:12.090
This incident will just go from the shadows and back into the shadows.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.800
Is there something else?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:19.840
Sergeant Major.

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:24.610
How many minutes have I been asleep?

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.270
No, thank you.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:32.420
You should be allowed to moisten your throat with droplets of grapes, at least,

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:36.510
even if your subordinates are in the midst of a mission now.

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:41.030
You haven't put anything in your mouth for all this time.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.570
Assault the ballroom party?!

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:03.960
What the hell are you guys thinking?!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:07.050
If this incident gets big, Paul won't be able to cover anything up.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:09.750
And if we can drag more idiotic nobles into this,

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.450
then we're prepared for execution.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:12.770
You think an execution is enough?!

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.780
You guys are all going to be tortured by Section I.

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:19.890
Your entire family, all of your friends, everyone!

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.140
Our family has nothing to do with this!

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:22.770
You think Section I cares?!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:26.010
An information breach as big as this...

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:30.330
Section I will use whatever means it needs to take to get the truth out of this.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.730
The more nobles killed in this incident,

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.540
the more excuses Section I obtains.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.060
Get going, Machs.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:38.760
Don't be playing with me.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:39.670
Get off!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:40.590
But...

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.430
You got hit on the head.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.110
You think I can take you into this carnage?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.890
Besides...

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.780
If something were to happen to you,

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:51.060
these guys will become homicide suspects.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.410
This injury was self-inflicted.

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:09.620
Hey Kiddo.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.730
You brought "that", right?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:11.310
Give it to me.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.460
S-Sergeant Major!!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.560
Quit complaining!

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:18.030
There's like a big hole opened on your head.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:19.560
This is the fastest way!

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:21.210
Shall I stop the car?

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:21.760
No!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.950
The time this guy got his butt kicked,

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:25.100
the time he was out cold,

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:26.710
the time we wasted talking...

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:28.430
We don't have any more time to waste!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.430
Oreld, are you pissed or something?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.550
Oh, I'm not pissed.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:37.010
I did set up a date with that girl from the volunteer group.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.010
I am somewhat jealous.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.080
He may be your subordinate,

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:46.560
but to see you worried about other men...

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.750
I...

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.340
My princess.

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:55.120
Would you allow me to accompany you to your bedroom tonight?

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:01.420
By driving away other males,

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.150
the young lion shall become the king.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:07.530
It always amazed me.

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.650
There's nothing behind your words,

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:10.900
no calculations,

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:12.090
no sarcasm.

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:13.940
Yes,

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.440
absolutely colorless words.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.400
Your words don't even give a sense of "you".

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:20.200
But your words just now were wonderful.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:24.090
You want to win over another man that simply appeared in a conversation or else you won't rest.

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:27.230
Those were Leonir Taylor's unfettered words.

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.410
That's...

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:43.290
Marquis Hoost.

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:46.220
His gentle personality makes him amicable to everyone.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.880
I'm quite late, I see.

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:52.060
The guest of honor makes his entrance.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:54.540
It must've been a lot of trouble to come in this snow.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.180
Please have something warm over there.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.600
That would be most agreeable.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:04.390
Many people want to push him to hold an important political post.

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:05.830
How imprudent.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.830
A VIP like him came without any bodyguards?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:11.080
The same could be said about you, my princess!

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.360
I can protect myself and my sisters-

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.670
Get away from the window!!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.340
Who are these people?

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:36.170
Hey, this isn't a place commoners can enter freely!

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:40.100
This is an act of justice!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.100
Director of the Economic Development Branch, Marquis Paul!

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:45.940
We will give you the punishment you deserve!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.370
Die!!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.170
Did you just say "justice"?

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.090
All preparations are complete.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.600
Block all roads that lead to the mansion.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.420
Don't allow even an ant to pass.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:16.100
Yes, sir!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:23.090
Section I boys are going out?

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:24.920
Something fishy's going on.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:27.820
Done.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.500
Well, this will do for now.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.160
What should I...

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.840
What should I have done?

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:41.040
I pointed my gun... not at enemy soldiers,

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.670
but at civilians that I should be protecting.

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:47.630
They were just holding shovels and hoes.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.680
I was just... so scared...

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:00.010
It happens.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:07.090
Machs and I have had that experience a few times.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:11.690
Of course, we never had our heads hit by a hammer.

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:14.750
The same can be said about the LT.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:18.070
Inside an angry city just after the armistice,

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:22.140
a soldier, the very people that wrecked all their lives,

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.210
was preaching war relief and stuff.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.430
Both punches and rocks were thrown at her.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.160
Then came jealousy and envy,

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:31.500
followed by stares of hatred, animosity,

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.010
and a full course of foul language.

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.680
What do you want, little girl?

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.050
That man over there...

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:43.940
...took advantage of his post as Director of the Economic Development Branch...

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.020
...and embezzled a large amount of money...

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:50.140
so that he can have fun like this every day!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.530
And this is proof of it!

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:02.100
Th-They're all forged documents!

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.850
These people are just jealous of me!

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.620
But of course we are!

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:11.160
Children of us commoners don't have anything to eat and suffer from illnesses because of that.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:13.420
Many of them end up dying like that.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:17.140
You nobles treat them like trash.

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:19.260
It's not just Paul!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.790
You are all targets of our punishment!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.080
But...

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.620
You're first!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.160
Paul,

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:30.730
you've eaten our lifetime's worth of food, right?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:31.980
Don't be hasty!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.630
If you pull the trigger, you'll endanger your family, as well.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:36.980
I don't have any.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.830
My son died from illness last year.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:42.970
His body was all skinny and bony.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:47.450
He was lighter than a bag of wheat...

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:52.760
Forgive me.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:53.700
But...

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.280
Sister?

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:58.980
Right now, he wants Paul's life.

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.550
But, we don't know what'll happen after that.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.190
We'll protect you until you reach the exit.

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:07.530
After that, rely on Mr. Gentleman over there.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.420
Sister!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:11.960
I-

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.520
It's okay if it's unfair!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:17.360
You should enjoy more of a girl's life!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.420
I will not back away.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.680
Alice!

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.520
I will not back away even a step.

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:27.050
Fly away, Machs!

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:28.150
No!

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:30.150
Lieutenant Webner is going to kill me!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:30.860
Sergeant Major!

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:31.920
Ahead! Ahead!

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:35.340
The tires lost their grip because of the snow!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:36.340
Outta the way!

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:52.020
We didn't run over anyone, right?

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.590
Hey, big guy-

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:01.670
Corporal...

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.410
Are you all right?

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.750
Wonderful...

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:19.580
Wh-What's wonderful?

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:22.180
This doesn't look wonderful at all.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:27.350
You are wonderful, indeed.

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:31.350
What's wonderful?!

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:37.250
Besides the LT, her two sisters are here, as well.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.430
Where?

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:41.770
Rumors have it that one of them is the bearer of the Empire's most plump set of breasts,

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:44.060
and the other one has the most conceited breasts.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:44.740
What?

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:50.080
Ah, those.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:52.500
That was pretty fast.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:55.880
Oh, you guys came at the right time.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.310
Marquis Paul.

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:59.440
Now, let me get on this car and-

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:00.220
We're not here to rescue you.
Now, let me get on this car and-

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.800
We're not here to rescue you.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.210
Quite the opposite.

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:05.510
Those documents again?

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.770
Do you have evidence that those are authentic?

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.060
Yes, we do.

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:12.930
Fifty copies of this fifty page document were made.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:15.250
Forty-nine of those pages are copies, however.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:19.780
Only one page has the stamp of the Economic Development Branch, the real one!

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:24.530
It must be that the fifty original copies were each separated into fifty sets.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:27.430
In other words, all fifty of them are fakes...

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:29.290
...and all fifty are authentic.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.840
According to these documents,

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:35.450
just last month alone, you embezzled seven million marks.

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:38.220
The large amounts of money we're managing...

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:41.810
...and you're telling me you were able to tell just by glancing at these documents?

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.800
Someone can do that in Section III.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:46.840
She messes up 2-digit addition,

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.210
but she's very good at this type of stuff.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.310
They're so slow...

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.520
Well, we can continue this in our office-

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.710
You guys are Section III, right?

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:59.820
As I recall, Section III doesn't have the right to arrest people.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.610
And it's blown...

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:03.370
Idiot.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:06.310
If we don't arrest him here, this riot won't be nipped in the bud.

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:11.280
Soldiers should be quelling this civilian riot.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:12.330
Go away!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.540
Soldiers, get out of my way!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:17.040
See what I said?

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:21.420
You guys are just watch dogs for the nobles.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.890
Saying all that admirable stuff;

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:25.100
you're going to kill us all afterwards, right?

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:26.050
We won't let you do that!

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.290
Kill them!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:33.190
What should I do?

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:35.900
Kill all soldiers and nobles!

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:37.390
What should I do?

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.600
Enough of this!!

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:43.900
A glove?

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:48.480
Indeed, Section III doesn't have the right to arrest.

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:50.240
Then, Marquis...

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:52.240
Right here, as a noble, I,

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.000
Alice L. Malvin,

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.360
challenge you to a duel!

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:35.050
Mer-kun, two skilled fighters from Loderia are entering the battle.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:36.740
What's going to happen to the ballroom party?

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:38.830
And at that time, what's Section III doing?

00:23:39.400 --> 00:23:41.380
Next time, "The Puppet and the Idol."

00:23:41.380 --> 00:23:43.410
Come get us if you dare!
